{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"id":1,"title":2,"inWords":3,"equation":4,"parameters":5,"outputs":12,"results":16,"assumptions":23,"buildsOn":26,"sameDomain":30,"citation":49,"learnMore":50},"ascent-guidance","Guida di ascesa (il computer di volo)","Pilotaggio lineare-tangenziale: sin γ = A + B·t — il seno dell'angolo di beccheggio segue una retta nel tempo. Due costanti guidano l'intera salita dal decollo verticale all'orbita orizzontale; questa semplicità è il motivo per cui la guida reale (PEG) la utilizza.","\u003Cspan class=\"katex-display\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-mathml\">\u003Cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\">\u003Csemantics>\u003Cmrow>\u003Cmi>sin\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>⁡\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>γ\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo stretchy=\"false\">(\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>t\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo stretchy=\"false\">)\u003C/mo>\u003Cmo>=\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>A\u003C/mi>\u003Cmo>+\u003C/mo>\u003Cmi>B\u003C/mi>\u003Cmtext> \u003C/mtext>\u003Cmi>t\u003C/mi>\u003Cmspace width=\"1em\"/>\u003Cmtext>(PEG linear-tangent steering)\u003C/mtext>\u003C/mrow>\u003Cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\gamma(t) = A + B\\,t \\quad\\text{(PEG linear-tangent steering)}\u003C/annotation>\u003C/semantics>\u003C/math>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-base\">\u003Cspan class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mop\">sin\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mopen\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\">t\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mclose\">)\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mrel\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C